#. Add a RO check button that defaults to RO
#: src/disk-image-mounter/main.c:100
msgid "Set up _read-only mount"
msgstr "Stel up _lees-enigste monteer"

#: src/disk-image-mounter/main.c:101
msgid ""
"If checked, the mount will be read-only. This is useful if you don’t want "
"the underlying disk image to be modified"
msgstr ""
"Indien gekontroleer, die monteer sal wees lees-enigste. Hierdie is nuttig as "
"jy doen nie wil hê die onderliggende skyf beeld om wees gemodifiseerde"

#: src/disk-image-mounter/main.c:142
